{"id":"n72682-1-10","stage":5,"title":"이점 · 好处","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72682-1-10-1","ko":"이 동네는 집값이 왜 이렇게 비싼지 모르겠어요.","zh":"真不明白，这个地区的房价怎么会这么贵啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"동네는","meaning":"小区，社区，村庄","explanation":"동네：小区，社区，村庄；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"동네","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62417","senseId":"2","lemma":"동네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"동네는","audio":"/audio/64282c8f2dc23b4012d9.mp3"}},{"text":"집값이","meaning":"房价","explanation":"집값：房价；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"집값","audio":"/audio/9dd02d163ab300ca77ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78368","senseId":"1","lemma":"집값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집값이","audio":"/audio/cccffa592ea23639184b.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"비싼지","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비싼지","audio":"/audio/c883d2608e6437a2906c.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f97ccdfe641c2837","term":"동네","zh":"小区，社区，村庄","audio":"/audio/f97ccdfe641c28373e6c.mp3","entryId":"62417","definition":"多户人家聚集在一起生活的地方。","pronunciation":["동ː네"]},{"id":"9dd02d163ab300ca","term":"집값","zh":"房价","audio":"/audio/9dd02d163ab300ca77ee.mp3","entryId":"78368","definition":"在出售或购买房子时，给房子标的价格。","pronunciation":["집깝"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9a767a1c9118d82c","term":"이렇게","zh":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3","entryId":"71156","definition":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不认识，不懂","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"不清楚或不了解人或事物、事实等。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b7e8a45f2fa89b801801.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72682-1-10-2","ko":"아무래도 학교와 지하철역 주변이라는 이점이 있어서 그렇겠지요.","zh":"大概是因为靠近学校和地铁站这个优势吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아무래도","meaning":"到底，还是","explanation":"아무래도：到底，还是。","readings":[{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71330","senseId":"1","lemma":"아무래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아무래도","audio":"/audio/f5dbee1c946c5e6b1fa7.mp3"}},{"text":"학교와","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；와：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교와","audio":"/audio/f232530d7a8d5ce26c53.mp3"}},{"text":"지하철역","meaning":"地铁站","explanation":"지하철역：地铁站。","readings":[{"term":"지하철역","audio":"/audio/64860555fc86a9fbcb01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77822","senseId":"1","lemma":"지하철역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지하철역","audio":"/audio/64860555fc86a9fbcb01.mp3"}},{"text":"주변이라는","meaning":"周围，周边","explanation":"주변：周围，周边；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라는：引用名词判断、名称或命令内容并修饰后面的名词。","readings":[{"term":"주변","audio":"/audio/09bfd0c3a7d1a7b22fbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61415","senseId":"1","lemma":"주변","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주변이라는","audio":"/audio/6c0f2d6b5827b448e3c1.mp3"}},{"text":"이점이","meaning":"好处，益处","explanation":"이점：好处，益处；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이점","audio":"/audio/6c73602962f7e8bafd34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72682","senseId":"1","lemma":"이점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이점이","audio":"/audio/90e9516e3652f9016100.mp3"}},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어서","audio":"/audio/8c518243ad11245b602e.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇겠지요.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；지요：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그